        - century is a round multiple of ten and the remainder is under ten** — 2000-2009,
        - 3000-3009, 1000-1009 — and the paired reading wins everywhere else, including
        - 2024 ("twenty twenty four") and 1101 ("eleven oh one"). Derived from `num2words`
